<title>USA: Wellington has 10.04 pct Advanced stake.</title>
<headline>Wellington has 10.04 pct Advanced stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment adviser Wellington Management Co said in a Securities and Exchange Commission 13G filing on Monday that it holds a 10.04 percent stake in Advanced Micro Devices Inc, or 13,580,700 common shares.</p>
<p>Filings under 13G are usually made by institutions and large investors with &quot;passive&quot; investment objectives in a company. Unlike 13D filings, 13G reports do not list the latest transactions.</p>
</text>
